# UI UX Rules

The app must be faster and easier than using Samsung Notes checkboxes.

Core flow:
Home Screen
-> Quick Item Selection
-> Confirm List
-> Shopping Mode

UX priorities:
- One-tap start from home.
- Swipe or tap between categories.
- Whole item row should be tappable.
- Selected count should always be visible.
- Quick buttons: Select All, Deselect All, Favorites, Frequent Items, Clear.
- Final shopping list should be grouped by category or store type.
- Shopping mode should be distraction-free.
- Avoid showing banner ads in active shopping mode for MVP.
- Use large tap targets.
- Use readable text.
- Support older users and small phones.

Implementation reminders:
- Keep search visible in Quick Item Selection.
- Keep confirm action obvious and always reachable.
- Use empty states with a clear next action.
